==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has reached 57 Million installs from players around the world! Celebrate this amazing milestone with special stages and events, {{Color|#FF00FF|'''February 1st (11am) through February 15th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● 57 Million Downloads Special Stages!'''}}<br>
Check out special stages, on for a limited time at the Event/Legend Stages during this celebration event.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''・ "Seeing Red" Stage Series!'''}}<br>
Face off against a tide of blood-red baddies! Can YOU beat all the Seeing Red stages?<br>
More stages appear as the event continues!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Seeing Red'''}}<br>
February 1st (11:00am) to February 15th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Seeing Red II'''}}<br>
February 3rd (11:00am) to February 15th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Seeing Red III'''}}<br>
February 5th (11:00am) to February 15th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Seeing Red ∞'''}}<br>
February 7th (11:00am) to February 15th (10:59am)<br>
The Cat Empire is counting on you to fight off the crimson menace!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● XP Festival Events!'''}}<br>
Get ready to power up your Cats to the max with the special stages {{Color|#FF00FF|Blitz XP,  XP Megablitz, XP Colosseum, and Merciless XP}} at Legend Stages!<br>
{{Color|#00BAFF|'''● Blitz XP Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''2/1, 2/3, 2/5, 2/7, 2/9, 2/11, 2/13'''}}　7:00 PM ～ 10:00 PM<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''2/2, 2/4, 2/6, 2/8, 2/10, 2/12, 2/14'''}}　11:00 AM ～ 2:00 PM<br>
{{Color|#00BAFF|'''● XP Megablitz Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''2/1, 2/3, 2/5, 2/7, 2/9, 2/11, 2/13'''}}　11:00 AM ～ 2:00 PM<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''2/2, 2/4, 2/6, 2/8, 2/10, 2/12, 2/14'''}}　7:00 PM ～ 10:00 PM<br>
{{Color|#00BAFF|'''● XP Colosseum Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''2/1, 2/4, 2/7, 2/10, 2/13'''}}　4:00 PM ～ 5:00 PM<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''2/2, 2/5, 2/8, 2/11, 2/14'''}}　10:00 PM ～ 11:00 PM<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''2/3, 2/6, 2/9, 2/12, 2/15'''}}　8:00 AM ～ 9:00 AM<br>
{{Color|#00BAFF|'''● Merciless XP Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''2/1, 2/10'''}}　10:00 PM ～ 11:00 PM<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''2/3, 2/12'''}}　4:00 PM ～ 5:00 PM<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''2/5, 2/8'''}}　8:00 AM ～ 9:00 AM<br>
Don't miss out on this chance!<br>
※Regularly occurring XP events will also be be available outside of the times listed above.<br>
※ XP Megablitz is available after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is cleared. XP Colosseum becomes available after Into the Future Ch. 1 is cleared. Merciless XP will be available after Into the Future Ch. 3 is cleared and User Rank 1600 reached.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Builder's Blitz!'''}}<br>
Clear the stage to collect building materials needed for a better Cat Base! Visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages during the times below to put your Cat Army to the test in the special stages {{Color|#3366FF|'''Cavern of Comets, Strait of Wings,'''}} and {{Color|#3366FF|'''Island of Ash'''}}!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00am～8:59am / 12:00pm～1:59pm / 6:00pm～7:59pm / 10:00pm～11:59pm'''}}<br>
Take on this challenge each day and stockpile building materials!<br>
※These stages will become available once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared.<br>
※ The Cavern of Comets, Strait of Wings, and Island of Ash stages will appear at regularly scheduled times in addition to the special campaign times listed above.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Treasure Festivals Everyday!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF9900|During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates}} in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Treasure Festival'''}}, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#008000|'''even days (2/2, 2/4, 2/6, 2/8, 2/10, 2/12, 2/14)'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00CC|Empire of Cats}}, and on {{Color|#00BAFF|'''odd days (2/1, 2/3, 2/5, 2/7, 2/9, 2/11, 2/13, 2/15)'''}} head to {{Color|#FF00CC|Into the Future}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|Cats of the Cosmos}} on {{Color|#0000FF|'''2/3, 2/6, 2/9, 2/12,  and 2/15!'''}}<br>
※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas {{Color|#00BAFF|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}} and {{Color|#00BAFF|'''XP Harvest'''}}  for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!<br>
Don't miss this special chance!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・XP Harvest (3 areas)'''}}<br>
February 1st (11:00am) thru February 8th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Cats Eye Cave'''}}<br>
February 8th (11:00am) thru February 15th (10:59am)

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Catfruit / Catseye Limited Item Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Catseye'''}} {{Color|#FF0000|'''Limited Capsules'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}}{{Color|#FF00CC|!}}<br>
Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!

{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・Catseye Item Capsules'''}}<br>
February 1st (11am) thru February 8th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・Catfruit Item Capsules'''}}<br>
February 8th (11am) thru February 15th (10:59am)

<small>※The Catfruit Limited Capsules provide Catfruit and XP rewards, while Catseye Limited Capsules will provide Catseyes and XP!<br>
※Catfruit Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is completed in The Battle Cats, and Catseye Limited Capsules will appear in the Cat Capsules once User Rank 1600 is cleared.</small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app to collect a reward of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} each day of the campaign!<br>
Don't miss a day for maximum Cat Food profit!

